Brand drawing tablet list
title end

paragraph start
A drawing tablet is optional. It earns a place only if the logo, icons or overlays need hand drawing that a mouse cannot do well.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Decide by trying a sketch task first. Buy only if the task was blocked.
paragraph end

